wwXB42EZUnfsKgLdYr5GkfmMPN-fxAttj-L5OWvWOtdGo0FIOt_Pm_eE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPIPLiVHFMGViQRdxm3D7TdnFWFX7Sp22NqIwhGA2y5Zw&oe=6AD23EDF"}, {"file_name": "s6.png", "id": "24320771054197657", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821178_24320771057530990_2120611191463787054_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yzku_4JKLWUQ7kNvwG2MjTV&_nc_oc=AdqfWt2-byVbVBsq0RT4T17bvT8T_IAGScFVlwnZsP3Gk3uueL9faudzh6IrhqEsvlE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNFxW-F6G8HZK_9ih5CSFl5_VKWxphs23QpC8hdf5VLiA&oe=6AD2358F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Car Jump VR-Ramp stunt", "keywords": ["carjumpvr", "carstunts", "rampjump", "magaramps", "carracinggames"], "long_description": "Welcome To the car jump ,i am your Car let's jump \nAre you ready to master extreme stunts? Take on the Car Jump VR-Ramp stunt game and embark on an adventure like no other. Gear up, rev your engines, and prepare for a high-flying, heart-stopping experience. The mega ramp car stunt game beckons\u2014the ramps are calling, and the stage is set for you to shine.\n\nKey Features of Mega Ramp Car Game:\n- Diverse selection of luxury racing stunt cars\n- Multiple HD graphics car racing tracks\n- Realistic and smooth controls for the mega ramp car game\n- Authentic sound effects enhancing the racing car game experience\n- Exciting car games simulator challenges with a focus on thrilling stunts\n- Perform daring stunts in the mega ramp racing game\n- Engaging and challenging levels", "short_description": "Are you ready to jump? Take on the Car jump VR-Ramp stunt and embark on an adventure like no other. Gear up, rev your engines, and prepare for a high-flying, heart-stopping experience. The mega ramp car stunt game beckons\u2014the ramps are calling, and the stage is set for you to shine."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.goog